<title>CANADA: CBRS assigns Loewen Group B++(low) rating.</title>
<headline>CBRS assigns Loewen Group B++(low) rating.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Bond Rating Service said on Monday it has assigned The Loewen Group a Senior Guaranteed Note rating of B++(low).</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable.</p>
<p>The Loewen Group is North America's second largest funeral home and cemetary operator, the service said.</p>
<p>Loewen has worked on improving its balance sheet by concentrating on acquiring and operating funeral homes and cemeteries, CBRS said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
